    "deterministic kinematic tape model, not on the physical robot: they keep the",
    "quantised boundary error inside one sensor pitch on a straight tape for both",
    "edges, and bounded on a gentle curve with noise and dropouts. Replace the",
    "geometry section with measured values and set measured=true, then record a",
    "measured counts_to_mps factor before any physical graph execution."
